# Review is the last line of defence for the files a supply chain attack has to
# touch. Everything listed here needs an explicit approval from an owner, so none of
# it can be skimmed through in a large diff.
#
# TODO: replace the placeholder below with the real team or handles before enabling
# branch protection. GitHub silently ignores an owner that does not exist, which
# would turn this file into decoration.

